 i det läge som ska detekteras (sida 496–498, not).","message_en":"Two-colour indicator: set the switch so that the indicator is lit red at the position to be detected (pages 496–498, note).","goto_step":"mhz2-switch"},{"severity":"info","if_json":{"and":[{"!=":[{"var":"switch"},""]},{"==":[{"var":"bore"},"10"]}]},"message_sv":"MHZ2-10 levereras med givarfästen när gripdonet beställs med givare; beställs givaren separat behövs fästet BMG2-012 (sida 497, not 3).","message_en":"MHZ2-10 ships with the auto switch mounting brackets when ordered with switches; a separately ordered switch needs the bracket BMG2-012 (page 497, note 3).","goto_step":"mhz2-switch"},{"severity":"info","if_json":{"and":[{"!=":[{"var":"switch"},""]},{"in":[{"var":"bore"},["16","20","25","32","40"]]}]},"message_sv":"Används givaren i det fyrkantiga spåret på sidan behövs fästet BMG2-012, som beställs separat (sida 497–498, not 3; fästen sida 545).","message_en":"When the switch is used in the square groove on the side the bracket BMG2-012 is required and ordered separately (pages 497–498, note 3; brackets page 545).","goto_step":"mhz2-switch"},{"severity":"info","if_json":{"and":[{"!=":[{"var":"switch"},""]},{"in":[{"var":"finger"},["2","N2"]]}]},"message_sv":"Genomgående hål: montering genom hålen går inte när givaren sitter i det fyrkantiga spåret på sidan (sida 497–498, not 2).","message_en":"Through-holes: through-hole mounting is not possible when the auto switch is used in the square groove on the side (pages 497–498, note 2).","goto_step":"mhz2-finger"},{"severity":"error","if_json":{"and":[{"==":[{"var":"mto"},"X46"]},{"in":[{"var":"bore"},["6","32","40"]]}]},"message_sv":"-X46 finns för ø10, 16, 20 och 25, inte ø6, 32 och 40 (sida 547, not).","message_en":"-X46 exists for ø10, 16, 20 and 25, not ø6, 32 and 40 (page 547, note).","goto_step":"mhz2-mto"}]'::jsonb) r;

